msgid "ReliefMath++"
msgstr "ReliefMath++"

msgid ""
"ReliefMath++ 是原生 FLTK 几何与函数绘图应用。程序命令为 ``reliefmathpp``，在 Office 分组中提供 "
"desktop 入口，支持直接打开 ``.rmathpp`` 文档。它与编辑和排版 LaTeX 的 ReliefMath 独立。"
msgstr ""
"ReliefMath++ is a native FLTK geometry and function-plotting application. "
"Its command is ``reliefmathpp``, with a desktop entry in the Office group "
"and direct opening of ``.rmathpp`` documents. It is independent of "
"ReliefMath, which edits and typesets LaTeX."

msgid "使用"
msgstr "Usage"

msgid "在“二维绘图”或“三维绘图”中选择对象工具。"
msgstr "Choose an object tool in 2D Plotting or 3D Plotting."

msgid "在左侧填写公式、坐标和范围，按“应用属性”或 ``Ctrl+Enter``。"
msgstr ""
"Enter formulas, coordinates, and ranges on the left, then click Apply "
"Properties or ``Ctrl+Enter``."

msgid "在右侧切换二维、三维视图；拖动平移或旋转，滚轮缩放，``Home`` 重置。“适合”按可见对象设置视图。"
msgstr ""
"Switch between 2D and 3D views on the right. Drag to pan or rotate, use the "
"wheel to zoom, and ``Home`` to reset. Fit adjusts the view to visible "
"objects."

msgid "参数 ``a``、``b``、``c``、``d`` 可用滑块调整，也可在右侧输入框中输入数值并按 Enter。"
msgstr ""
"Adjust parameters ``a``, ``b``, ``c``, and ``d`` with sliders, or enter "
"values in the right-hand fields and press Enter."

msgid "在“计算与工具”中使用函数计算、三维函数计算、值表、几何度量、向量和拾点构造。"
msgstr ""
"Calculation and Tools provides function evaluation, 3D function evaluation, "
"value tables, geometric measurements, vectors, and point-picking "
"constructions."

msgid ""
"提供正弦/余弦/圆、波纹曲面/螺旋线、环面/向量、玫瑰线/椭圆四组示例。新对象使用可直接绘制的默认数据。属性栏按当前类型收起无关公式和坐标控件；第二个采样范围只用于二变量对象。短窗口中可滚动查看。"
msgstr ""
"Four example groups cover sine/cosine/circle, ripple surface/helix, "
"torus/vectors, and rose curve/ellipse. New objects use directly plottable "
"defaults. The property pane hides irrelevant formula and coordinate controls"
" for the current type; the second sampling range applies only to two-"
"variable objects. Scroll in short windows."

msgid "对象"
msgstr "Objects"

msgid ""
"类别：二维函数; 支持内容：``y=f(x)``、隐式 ``F(x,y)=0``、极坐标 ``r(t)``、参数曲线 ``x(t),y(t)``; "
"公式变量：x/y 或 t"
msgstr ""
"Category: 2D Functions; Supported: ``y=f(x)``, implicit ``F(x,y)=0``, polar "
"``r(t)``, parametric curves ``x(t),y(t)``; Variables: x/y or t"

msgid "类别：二维几何; 支持内容：点、线段、向量、圆、椭圆、三角形、矩形; 公式变量：数值坐标和尺寸"
msgstr ""
"Category: 2D Geometry; Supported: points, segments, vectors, circles, "
"ellipses, triangles, rectangles; Variables: numeric coordinates and "
"dimensions"

msgid ""
"类别：三维函数; 支持内容：``z=f(x,y)``、参数曲面 ``x(u,v),y(u,v),z(u,v)``、空间参数曲线 "
"``x(t),y(t),z(t)``; 公式变量：x/y、u/v 或 t"
msgstr ""
"Category: 3D Functions; Supported: ``z=f(x,y)``, parametric surfaces "
"``x(u,v),y(u,v),z(u,v)``, spatial parametric curves ``x(t),y(t),z(t)``; "
"Variables: x/y, u/v, or t"

msgid "类别：三维几何; 支持内容：点、线段、向量、三角形、任意朝向平面、球、长方体、沿 Z 轴的圆柱和圆锥; 公式变量：数值坐标和尺寸"
msgstr ""
"Category: 3D Geometry; Supported: points, segments, vectors, triangles, "
"arbitrarily oriented planes, spheres, cuboids, Z-axis cylinders and cones; "
"Variables: numeric coordinates and dimensions"

msgid ""
"所有公式还可以使用 ``a/b/c/d``。坐标框使用英文逗号分隔，例如 ``0,0,3``。平面输入法向量与常数，遵循 "
"``nx*x+ny*y+nz*z=d``。三维使用正交软件投影，无 GPU 或联网依赖；支持面片着色和完整线框。"
msgstr ""
"All formulas can also use ``a/b/c/d``. Coordinate fields use ASCII commas, "
"for example ``0,0,3``. Planes take a normal vector and constant, following "
"``nx*x+ny*y+nz*z=d``. 3D uses orthographic software projection without GPU "
"or network dependencies, with shaded facets and full wireframes."

msgid "表达式"
msgstr "Expressions"

msgid "常量：``pi``、``tau``、``e``，角度统一为弧度。"
msgstr "Constants: ``pi``, ``tau``, ``e``; all angles use radians."

msgid ""
"运算：``+ - * / % ^``、``< <= > >= == !=``、``&& ||``；``^`` "
"右结合，``-2^2=-4``，``2^3^2=512``。"
msgstr ""
"Operators: ``+ - * / % ^``, ``< <= > >= == !=``, ``&& ||``; ``^`` is right-"
"associative, ``-2^2=-4``, ``2^3^2=512``."

msgid ""
"一元函数：``sin cos tan asin acos atan sinh cosh tanh exp ln log log10 log2 sqrt "
"abs floor ceil round sign``。"
msgstr ""
"Unary functions: ``sin cos tan asin acos atan sinh cosh tanh exp ln log "
"log10 log2 sqrt abs floor ceil round sign``."

msgid ""
"多元函数：``min(a,b)``、``max(a,b)``、``pow(a,b)``、``atan2(y,x)``、``hypot(a,b)``、``if(条件,真值,假值)``。"
msgstr ""
"Multi-argument functions: ``min(a,b)``, ``max(a,b)``, ``pow(a,b)``, "
"``atan2(y,x)``, ``hypot(a,b)``, ``if(条件,真值,假值)``."

msgid "乘法必须写 ``*``，如 ``2*x``、``a*sin(x)``；不接受 LaTeX、脚本、文件访问或外部命令。"
msgstr ""
"Multiplication requires ``*``, such as ``2*x`` or ``a*sin(x)``. LaTeX, "
"scripts, file access, and external commands are not accepted."

msgid "未定义和非有限值不参与曲线连线；曲线、曲面和隐式绘制均采用有限采样，间断检测为数值启发式。"
msgstr ""
"Undefined and nonfinite values do not participate in curve connections. "
"Curves, surfaces, and implicit plots all use finite sampling; discontinuity "
"detection is a numerical heuristic."

msgid "计算和导出"
msgstr "Calculation and Export"

msgid ""
"二维显函数支持函数值、一二阶导数、定积分、端点夹根、两函数交点、区间极值搜索、弧长和切线。三维显函数支持函数值、梯度/法向量、拉普拉斯算子、切平面、矩形区域二重积分和曲面面积。切线与切平面保存计算当时的数值参数。"
msgstr ""
"2D explicit functions support values, first/second derivatives, definite "
"integrals, endpoint-bracketed roots, intersections of two functions, "
"interval extrema searches, arc lengths, and tangents. 3D explicit functions "
"support values, gradients/normals, Laplacians, tangent planes, rectangular "
"double integrals, and surface areas. Tangents and tangent planes retain "
"numeric parameters from the time of calculation."

msgid "几何度量提供长度/周长、面积/表面积和体积；椭圆周长使用近似公式。向量工具提供点积、叉积、长度、夹角、两点距离、中点和平行四边形面积。"
msgstr ""
"Geometric measurements provide length/perimeter, area/surface area, and "
"volume; ellipse perimeter uses an approximation. Vector tools provide "
"dot/cross products, length, angle, distance between two points, midpoint, "
"and parallelogram area."

msgid ""
"支持当前视图 SVG 和 PNG；二维值表支持 CSV，最多 2000 行，未定义值标为 ``undefined``。SVG 保留文字和矢量图元；PNG"
" 从独立 FLTK 图像表面获取，与实际绘图使用相同绘制路径。导出不允许覆盖正在编辑的文档或其别名。"
msgstr ""
"Export the current view as SVG or PNG. 2D value tables export CSV up to 2000"
" rows, marking undefined values ``undefined``. SVG preserves text and vector"
" primitives; PNG comes from a separate FLTK image surface using the same "
"drawing path as the actual plot. Export cannot overwrite the document being "
"edited or its aliases."

msgid "存储、响应性和限制"
msgstr "Storage, Responsiveness, and Limits"

msgid ""
"``.rmathpp`` 为 ``RMPP`` 魔数、版本 1 的小端格式，记录总长度与 "
"CRC32。保存对象、四个参数、坐标轴/网格/线框、二维中心和范围、三维相机旋转/缩放/中心，以及活动视图。加载先完整校验，失败不替换现有文档。"
msgstr ""
"``.rmathpp`` is little-endian version 1 with ``RMPP`` magic, total length, "
"and CRC32. It saves objects, four parameters, axes/grid/wireframe, 2D "
"center/range, 3D camera rotation/zoom/center, and active view. Loading "
"validates everything before replacing the document; failure leaves the "
"existing document intact."

msgid ""
"复用 ``relieftodo/storage.h`` 的无异常容器及 ``relieftodo/file_io.cpp`` "
"的事务文件工作进程；共享保存锁负责同目录多个窗口的互斥。保存处理短写、同步、原子替换、符号链接与外部修改冲突。文件操作时禁用文档编辑，避免保存快照与界面状态不一致。"
msgstr ""
"It reuses the exception-free containers in ``relieftodo/storage.h`` and "
"transactional file worker in ``relieftodo/file_io.cpp``. Shared save locks "
"serialize multiple windows in the same directory. Saving handles short "
"writes, synchronization, atomic replacement, symbolic links, and external "
"modification conflicts. Document editing is disabled during file operations "
"to keep save snapshots consistent with interface state."

msgid ""
"采样在 FLTK 定时器里按曲线段或网格行分批处理；修改会取消旧采样。数值计算运行在可取消的子进程，20 "
"秒仍未返回则终止并报告未取得可靠结果。所有图形控件沿用公共 ``fltk_support.h`` 的默认 gtk+ scheme 和中文字体。"
msgstr ""
"Sampling runs in batches of curve segments or grid rows in FLTK timers; "
"changes cancel old sampling. Numerical calculations run in cancellable child"
" processes. If they do not return within 20 seconds, they are terminated and"
" reported as not yielding reliable results. All graphical controls use the "
"shared ``fltk_support.h`` default gtk+ scheme and Chinese fonts."

msgid "每文档最多 64 个对象；名称 128 字节，公式 1024 字节，最多 512 条表达式指令、48 层语法嵌套。"
msgstr ""
"Each document allows 64 objects; names are limited to 128 bytes, formulas to"
" 1024 bytes, expressions to 512 instructions and 48 syntax nesting levels."

msgid "文件和导出数据最多 16 MiB；坐标绝对值不超过 ``1e8``，采样范围不超过 ``1e6``。"
msgstr ""
"Files and exported data are limited to 16 MiB. Absolute coordinates may not "
"exceed ``1e8``, and sampling ranges may not exceed ``1e6``."

msgid "网格每轴 16–96，二维曲线每对象最多 1536 段；多对象时限制有效网格精度和总绘图面片。"
msgstr ""
"Grids use 16–96 points per axis and 2D curves at most 1536 segments per "
"object. Multiple objects limit effective grid precision and total plotted "
"facets."

msgid "运算采用双精度浮点。求导和积分不提供符号表达式；误差估计不是严格误差界。"
msgstr ""
"Calculations use double-precision floating point. Differentiation and "
"integration do not produce symbolic expressions; error estimates are not "
"rigorous bounds."

msgid "求根要求连续且端点异号，不保证找到偶重根或所有零点；极值使用采样与局部细化，不构成全局最优证明。"
msgstr ""
"Root finding requires continuity and opposite signs at endpoints; it does "
"not guarantee even-multiplicity roots or all zeros. Extrema use sampling and"
" local refinement and do not prove global optimality."

msgid "二重积分和面积使用 24/48 两级 Simpson 网格；奇点、高频振荡、窄峰及细小结构可能超出采样能力。"
msgstr ""
"Double integrals and areas use two-level 24/48 Simpson grids. Singularities,"
" high-frequency oscillations, narrow peaks, and fine structures may exceed "
"sampling capability."

msgid "三维面片按深度排序；相互穿插曲面的遮挡、线框和近距离视角存在软件投影限制。"
msgstr ""
"3D facets are depth-sorted. Occlusion of intersecting surfaces, wireframes, "
"and close viewpoints are subject to software-projection limitations."
